      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi! I think your problem isn't in the scope of VRChat team because they are not developing EAC themselves so they probably can't fix any EAC \"core\" issues. Are you sure you have correctly re-enabled Driver Signature Enforcement with those steps?\nhttps://answers.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/forum/all/how-to-re-enable-driver-signature-enforcement/8c4c7f63-2956-49c5-9d4f-706cb868a3f2",
