  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello! Recently, I had a friend over. They removed something from my computer that had made the \"Test Mode\" text appear on the bottom right of my primary monitor. However, soon after, I kept getting this weird error from EasyAntiCheat whenever I tried to open VRChat in any way, shape or form. I do not know why this is happening, but I would like some help fixing this. I use VRChat as a means of communication between friends from outside the states, so this really is something I want fixed ASAP. If anyone knows what's going on, please help!",
